    "h1": {
      "en": "Camera",
      "zh": "摄像头"
    },
    "lede": {
      "en": "The camera mounts on the right side of the frame and faces the phone screen.",
      "zh": "摄像头装在框架右侧，正对手机屏幕。"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "tall-left",
    "page": "camera_10",
    "head": {
      "title": {
        "en": "CAMERA",
        "zh": "摄像头"
      },
      "small": "camera_10"
    },
    "variant": "hero",
    "figures": [
      {
        "src": "camera_10_bracket_exploded_cam1.svg"
      },
      {
        "src": "camera_10_bracket_assembled_cam0.svg"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "1/4-20, not metric",
          "zh": "1/4-20 英制，不是公制"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The SHCS and hex nut for the gooseneck are 1/4-20, the imperial tripod thread (≈ 6.35 mm). Do not use an M6 instead.",
          "zh": "金属软管用 1/4-20 圆柱头螺栓和六角螺母。1/4-20 是英制三脚架螺纹（约 6.35 mm）。不要用 M6 代替。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:120mm; top:30mm; width:70mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Imperial tools",
          "zh": "英制工具"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The 1/4-20 SHCS takes a 3/16\" hex key. The 1/4-20 hex nut takes a 7/16\" (or metric 11 mm) open-end wrench. Needle-nose pliers also do the job. There is no need to buy tools for this.",
          "zh": "1/4-20 圆柱头螺栓用 3/16\" 内六角扳手。1/4-20 六角螺母用 7/16\"（或公制 11 mm）开口扳手。也可用尖嘴钳代替。无需专门购买工具。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:130mm; top:120mm; width:70mm;"
      }
    ],
    "bom": {
      "label": {
        "en": "Bill of materials",
        "zh": "物料清单"
      },
      "rows": [
