          "en": "Thread on the gooseneck",
          "zh": "拧上金属软管"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Thread the gooseneck's female end onto the stud until it is tight against the hex nut.",
          "zh": "把金属软管的内螺纹端拧到螺柱上，直到贴紧六角螺母。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:140mm; top:80mm; width:60mm;"
